{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2207,
      "hub_id": 2910,
      "guid": "katrin0522.fastsellinflea",
      "name": "Fast Sell In Flea",
      "slug": "fast-sell-in-flea",
      "teaser": "Quickly add items on the flea market with automatic fitting of the current price",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2910.png",
      "downloads": 63720,
      "favourites_count": 92,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Mod for those who are tired of every time to enter the price offer to sell an item.</h3></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Specially when there are many items….</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How it works:</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>In the context menu of item, a price is added to the <strong>Add Offer</strong> button if you hold <em>LeftShift</em> (default keybind).</li>\n<li>If you press the button with the keybind held down(price show), the offer is added instantly, without going to the add offer screen.</li>\n<li>The price is automatically setup from the current prices of the flea market.</li>\n<li>You can select a preset target price(Min, Arg, Max) on the market, as well as set an amount to subtract Value OR Percent from that base price(Configurable)</li>\n<li>Supports multi-selection from UIFixes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If Shift is not held, the button works as a normal add-offer action.</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"Mh53jclPIgQ\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Mh53jclPIgQ?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Mh53jclPIgQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<hr /></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Extract the BepInEx folder from the 7z a</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Special Thanks to Translators:</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- French translation by Diadara</p>\n<p>- Japanese correction translation by 秋 (Ak1zm)</p>\n<p>- Spanish correction translation by VΛRIΛͶT</p>\n<p><em>If you want to correct the translation of the notifications, write in the comments</em></p>\n<p><em>Other languages translated by DeepL Translator</em></p>\n<p><em>It’s just two lines, but even these small texts feel nicer in YOUR own language.</em></p></div></div></div>\n",
